WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.560
These are events:

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:05.240
festivals, potlucks, meetups and sanctuary days,

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.800
in your chapter and around the world.

00:00:08.619 --> 00:00:11.000
Pick a place and the kinds of events you like.

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:14.240
Our team checks every event before it shows,

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.620
and we read its official page every week,

00:00:16.879 --> 00:00:18.380
so the details stay right.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:22.440
Some events even have members-only tickets through our group link.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:24.340
We want to hear from you.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:28.060
As a member, you shape what is on the calendar:

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:31.960
tap I'm going, submit an event from a flyer or a link,

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.700
let us know if something needs to be fixed,

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:39.640
and if you run events, claim yours and open the free Vegan Events Guide.

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:41.640
Membership is free.

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:45.680
We ask for a short survey so we know real people are joining,

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:48.080
and that keeps this community worth your time.

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:49.860
Bring people with you:

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:53.600
invite your friends, your community, new Vegans and Pre-Vegans.

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:56.940
And you earn points for everybody who joins using your link.

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:01.400
That is the easiest way to grow your experience and open new doors in our

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:02.000
community.

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:04.420
Go find something to do this week.

